  <data name="ht1" xml:space="preserve"><value>Funda izinkomba</value></data>
  <data name="ht1b" xml:space="preserve"><value>Inombolo ngayinye ingumugqa owodwa ongaphukile wezigaxa ezigcwele, zibhalwe ngokulandelana. Inkomba yomugqa ethi 3 1 isho ezintathu ndawonye, okungenani isikhala esisodwa, bese eyodwa iyodwa.</value></data>
  <data name="ht2" xml:space="preserve"><value>Gcwalisa bese ufaka u-X</value></data>
  <data name="ht2b" xml:space="preserve"><value>Thinta ibhokisi ukuligcwalisa. Shintshela kumodi ka-X emabhokisini owafakazele ukuthi ahlala engenalutho. U-X akuwona umhlobiso — yindlela obamba ngayo umkhondo.</value></data>
  <data name="ht3" xml:space="preserve"><value>Ukugqagqana ezinkombeni ezinde</value></data>
  <data name="ht3b" xml:space="preserve"><value>Emgqeni obubanzi obungu-10, inkomba engu-8 kumele imboze amabhokisi ayisi-6 aphakathi, noma iqala kuphi. Cindezela umugqa ngakwesobunxele, ucindezele ngakwesokudla, bese ugcwalisa lokho okugqagqanayo.</value></data>
  <data name="ht4" xml:space="preserve"><value>Qhathanisa umugqa nekholomu</value></data>
  <data name="ht4b" xml:space="preserve"><value>Uma umugqa ukunika isigaxa esiqinisekile, bheka phansi kuleyo kholomu. Isigaxa esisha sivame ukuqedela inkomba yekholomu, okunika ama-X amaningi, okunika izigaxa eziningi.</value></data>
  <data name="ht5" xml:space="preserve"><value>Faka u-X emigqeni ephelele</value></data>
  <data name="ht5b" xml:space="preserve"><value>Uma umugqa uhambisana ngokuphelele nezinkomba zawo, faka u-X kubo bonke amabhokisi asele. Izinombolo ziyafiphala ukuze wazi ukuthi lowo mugqa uphelile.</value></data>
